Our LaH10±δ sample was synthesized at 165 GPa ultrahigh pressure and 1700 K high temperature, with a lateral size of 10 × 20 μm2, for which the details are described in ref. 20. The characteristic onset transition temperature Tc of our LaH10±δ sample was initially determined to be 240–250 K by the transport measurement20. The re-measured transition temperature is depicted in the main text. The symmetry of the lattice structure of LaH10±δ has been previously identified to be \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
